# Crash into the cycle's own trail, then turn along it in slow motion: shots about a game frame
# apart while the camera eases round with the trail 25 to the side.
wait 17
press c 3
wait 2
press right
wait 0.5
press right
wait 0.5
press right
wait 1.5
press z
wait 0.5
press right
shot cs_01
